{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/005-first-project-frames/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Wood Times"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"f2c8fc0b-dfc6-54b4-a6ec-682b5f7a3537","excerpt":"Every woodworker remembers their first real project. Mine came with a request from a my brothers who were moving their fly fishing shop to a new location and…","html":"<p>Every woodworker remembers their first real project. Mine came with a request from a my brothers who were moving their fly fishing shop to a new location and wanted to take some peices of the wall that had been signed by well known fishermen and artists. It was the perfect first project: simple joinery, a clear purpose, and a deadline that would keep me from overthinking things.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/400e951d3f8e02b31a4e9066a6e8616f/2a4bc/working_on_lumber.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Working on Lumber\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/400e951d3f8e02b31a4e9066a6e8616f/f058b/working_on_lumber.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/400e951d3f8e02b31a4e9066a6e8616f/c26ae/working_on_lumber.png 158w,\n/static/400e951d3f8e02b31a4e9066a6e8616f/6bdcf/working_on_lumber.png 315w,\n/static/400e951d3f8e02b31a4e9066a6e8616f/f058b/working_on_lumber.png 630w,\n/static/400e951d3f8e02b31a4e9066a6e8616f/40601/working_on_lumber.png 945w,\n/static/400e951d3f8e02b31a4e9066a6e8616f/78612/working_on_lumber.png 1260w,\n/static/400e951d3f8e02b31a4e9066a6e8616f/2a4bc/working_on_lumber.png 3264w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>With the shop finally set up and the dust collector humming, it was time to put the tools to work. The first cuts on the table saw felt momentous, even if they were just simple rips to dimension some oak.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/3cd951a26c69914fb564ec9c5931bc6e/2a4bc/frame_pieces.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Frame Pieces\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/3cd951a26c69914fb564ec9c5931bc6e/f058b/frame_pieces.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/3cd951a26c69914fb564ec9c5931bc6e/c26ae/frame_pieces.png 158w,\n/static/3cd951a26c69914fb564ec9c5931bc6e/6bdcf/frame_pieces.png 315w,\n/static/3cd951a26c69914fb564ec9c5931bc6e/f058b/frame_pieces.png 630w,\n/static/3cd951a26c69914fb564ec9c5931bc6e/40601/frame_pieces.png 945w,\n/static/3cd951a26c69914fb564ec9c5931bc6e/78612/frame_pieces.png 1260w,\n/static/3cd951a26c69914fb564ec9c5931bc6e/2a4bc/frame_pieces.png 3264w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The artwork included pieces by Tim Borskiu and other fishing artists. Beautiful ink drawings of trout and tarpon, some with their signature flies attached. The frames needed to be simple enough not to compete with the art, but sturdy enough to protect these signed originals.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/aadca62e12795127d1cb91bb53977c35/2a4bc/large_frame.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Large Frame\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/aadca62e12795127d1cb91bb53977c35/f058b/large_frame.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/aadca62e12795127d1cb91bb53977c35/c26ae/large_frame.png 158w,\n/static/aadca62e12795127d1cb91bb53977c35/6bdcf/large_frame.png 315w,\n/static/aadca62e12795127d1cb91bb53977c35/f058b/large_frame.png 630w,\n/static/aadca62e12795127d1cb91bb53977c35/40601/large_frame.png 945w,\n/static/aadca62e12795127d1cb91bb53977c35/78612/large_frame.png 1260w,\n/static/aadca62e12795127d1cb91bb53977c35/2a4bc/large_frame.png 3264w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The larger pieces, like this tarpon drawing, required some creative clamping solutions.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/c8c328ed7fc2e60b76b1c42f1056928c/2a4bc/clamping.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Clamping\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/c8c328ed7fc2e60b76b1c42f1056928c/f058b/clamping.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/c8c328ed7fc2e60b76b1c42f1056928c/c26ae/clamping.png 158w,\n/static/c8c328ed7fc2e60b76b1c42f1056928c/6bdcf/clamping.png 315w,\n/static/c8c328ed7fc2e60b76b1c42f1056928c/f058b/clamping.png 630w,\n/static/c8c328ed7fc2e60b76b1c42f1056928c/40601/clamping.png 945w,\n/static/c8c328ed7fc2e60b76b1c42f1056928c/78612/clamping.png 1260w,\n/static/c8c328ed7fc2e60b76b1c42f1056928c/2a4bc/clamping.png 3264w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>It’s hack to say, but always true… you can never have too many clamps.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/0beb17d02597c893bd435b36a0e3c5ad/2a4bc/small_frames.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Small Frames\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/0beb17d02597c893bd435b36a0e3c5ad/f058b/small_frames.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/0beb17d02597c893bd435b36a0e3c5ad/c26ae/small_frames.png 158w,\n/static/0beb17d02597c893bd435b36a0e3c5ad/6bdcf/small_frames.png 315w,\n/static/0beb17d02597c893bd435b36a0e3c5ad/f058b/small_frames.png 630w,\n/static/0beb17d02597c893bd435b36a0e3c5ad/40601/small_frames.png 945w,\n/static/0beb17d02597c893bd435b36a0e3c5ad/78612/small_frames.png 1260w,\n/static/0beb17d02597c893bd435b36a0e3c5ad/2a4bc/small_frames.png 3264w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The smaller frames featured fly fishing flies mounted alongside artist signatures.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/51e0c6acc4e86280313b4ab41eef6835/493ac/installed_single.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Installed Single\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/51e0c6acc4e86280313b4ab41eef6835/f058b/installed_single.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/51e0c6acc4e86280313b4ab41eef6835/c26ae/installed_single.png 158w,\n/static/51e0c6acc4e86280313b4ab41eef6835/6bdcf/installed_single.png 315w,\n/static/51e0c6acc4e86280313b4ab41eef6835/f058b/installed_single.png 630w,\n/static/51e0c6acc4e86280313b4ab41eef6835/40601/installed_single.png 945w,\n/static/51e0c6acc4e86280313b4ab41eef6835/78612/installed_single.png 1260w,\n/static/51e0c6acc4e86280313b4ab41eef6835/493ac/installed_single.png 4032w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>Seeing the first frame hung on the new shop wall was a proud moment. The simple oak profile complemented the artwork without overwhelming it.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/30fec3e601c8e28c42f817e48a90a2de/493ac/installed_wall.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Installed Wall\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/30fec3e601c8e28c42f817e48a90a2de/f058b/installed_wall.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/30fec3e601c8e28c42f817e48a90a2de/c26ae/installed_wall.png 158w,\n/static/30fec3e601c8e28c42f817e48a90a2de/6bdcf/installed_wall.png 315w,\n/static/30fec3e601c8e28c42f817e48a90a2de/f058b/installed_wall.png 630w,\n/static/30fec3e601c8e28c42f817e48a90a2de/40601/installed_wall.png 945w,\n/static/30fec3e601c8e28c42f817e48a90a2de/78612/installed_wall.png 1260w,\n/static/30fec3e601c8e28c42f817e48a90a2de/493ac/installed_wall.png 4032w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>More frames went up, and suddenly there was a gallery wall taking shape among the bins of fly tying materials.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/ce9d2df550882b47060dae44e0f36d83/a878e/tarpon_installed.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Tarpon Installed\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/ce9d2df550882b47060dae44e0f36d83/f058b/tarpon_installed.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/ce9d2df550882b47060dae44e0f36d83/c26ae/tarpon_installed.png 158w,\n/static/ce9d2df550882b47060dae44e0f36d83/6bdcf/tarpon_installed.png 315w,\n/static/ce9d2df550882b47060dae44e0f36d83/f058b/tarpon_installed.png 630w,\n/static/ce9d2df550882b47060dae44e0f36d83/40601/tarpon_installed.png 945w,\n/static/ce9d2df550882b47060dae44e0f36d83/78612/tarpon_installed.png 1260w,\n/static/ce9d2df550882b47060dae44e0f36d83/a878e/tarpon_installed.png 2048w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>Great success!</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"First Project - Fly Fishing Frames","date":"October 15, 2017","description":null}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/003-every-shop-needs-a-bench/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Every Shop needs a Bench"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/004-leading-cast-of-tools/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"The Leading Cast of Tools"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"f2c8fc0b-dfc6-54b4-a6ec-682b5f7a3537","previousPostId":"a1ec45b8-6818-58e8-aeec-2303df795174","nextPostId":"9450d3aa-3503-5eb5-9cab-dded12214fdc"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2841359383"],"slicesMap":{}}